     "<div dir=\"ltr\"> <br>Hey, guys I need information regarding a what server should I use for hosting a web app I made recently. The thing is I tried  <span style=\"color:rgb(230,145,56)\">install.packages(&quot;rApache&quot;)</span> but as it so happens it doesn&#39;t support R version 3.0.2 or 3.0.1.<br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,34,64)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\"><font color=\"#000000\"> I&#39;m using libraries <span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,0)\">shiny</span> and <span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,0)\">RPostgreSQL.</span><br>So please tell me what other version should be compatible with All three packages so that I can put my app online.<br>Thank you.<br></font></span></pre></span></div>"
    ]
